  "briefing": "Meridian Combine holds Central Australia through its freight sidings. Reconnect 3 relays, take down the site warden, hold the uplink while it broadcasts, unlock the service gate, then leave by the exit. Expect 16 enemy agents and 6 guards on the streets.",
  "story": "Central Australia Blackout: Meridian Combine runs Central Australia from its freight sidings, and the district only notices when the lights go out. Your team has one night to reconnect the relays, silence the warden, hold the uplink and walk out the exit.",
